#: api/abilities/site.php:64
msgid "Changes a menu, or creates one with create. items is a list of operations, run in order: { op: add, title, url } or { op: add, object: post type or taxonomy, object_id, title }; { op: update, id, title, url, parent, position }; { op: remove, id }. parent nests an item under another: an item ID, or the ref of an item added earlier in the same call, so { op: add, ref: \"school\", title: \"School\", url } then { op: add, parent: \"school\", ... } builds a nested menu in one call. position is the item's place in the menu, from 1; new items go at the end. order arranges many at once, and items left out follow the ones listed. name renames the menu; on phones the menu toggle shows it. location puts the menu in a theme location."
